<p>GHD Agency (Greatest Home Decor LLC, DBA GHD Agency.ai) wants everyone to be able to use this website, including people with disabilities. We are working to make ghdagency.ai easier to read, navigate and use.</p>

<h2>Our Standard</h2>
<p>We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 at Level AA. We review the site against these guidelines as we build and update it. This is an ongoing effort, and we do not claim that every page meets every guideline today.</p>

<h2>What We Do</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Use real headings, lists, links and buttons so screen readers and keyboards can move through each page.</li>
  <li>Support keyboard navigation, with a visible focus outline on interactive elements.</li>
  <li>Keep text and background colors at readable contrast levels.</li>
  <li>Provide text alternatives for meaningful images.</li>
  <li>Respect your device's reduced-motion setting, and offer a reduce-motion option in the accessibility menu.</li>
  <li>Label every form field.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Accessibility Menu</h2>
<p>The accessibility button at the lower left of every page opens a menu where you can increase or decrease text size, turn on higher contrast, underline links, and reduce motion. Your choices are saved in your browser on this device.</p>

<h2>Known Limitations</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The booking calendar is provided by a third-party service. We are working with our provider, and if you cannot use it, contact us and we will schedule your session by phone or email.</li>
  <li>Some animated and decorative elements, including the logo animation and the scrolling opening sequence, are not essential to the content. Turn on reduce motion to replace them with static versions.</li>
  <li>Some third-party content, such as embedded video, may not meet every guideline.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Feedback and Assistance</h2>
<p>If you have trouble using any part of this site, or need information in another format, please tell us. We aim to respond within two business days.</p>
